    "gabc": "(c4) DI(gg)co(g) au(g)tem(gh~) vo(hvGF//g.h!iwjg)bis(g.) *(,) a(gh)mí(jkjk)cis(ij) me(hjI'G)is :(g.) (;) ne(g) ter(hih)re(g)á(e)mi(ffg)ni(gvFED.) (,) ab(fg) his,(ghgh) qui(fg) vos(g.h!iwjg) per(f)se(ghg)quún(h!jj/hi~)tur.(g.) (::)",
